{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is being consumed by the overwhelming resentment of gamblers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankrupt madmen, corrupt dealers, greedy spirits\u2026 Their bitterness and rage have morphed into a sinister energy, devouring everything in its path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must wield the &quot;gambler\u2019s magic,&quot; build a unique deck, and confront this spreading madness!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Cards! Break the Curse with Your Hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form classic poker hands\u2014Pairs, Straights, Flushes, Full Houses\u2014to build up your heroes\u2019 morale and unleash powerful actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/1956e9206c6c2f86d7889450c81aeab7.poster.avif?t=1772066433\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/1956e9206c6c2f86d7889450c81aeab7.webm?t=1772066433\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/1956e9206c6c2f86d7889450c81aeab7.mp4?t=1772066433\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Positioning is Strategy, Multiplier Under Your Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your heroes\u2019 rage directly influences the base multiplier of each hand. Adjust their stance, choose your bonuses, and turn the tide of battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473410/extras/6854650f8b8c4f5077dac5878226954d.poster.avif?t=1772066433\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a